# S5a: TIMED arm of the paired ABAB on coding prompts (audits OFF; both arms carry the in-trace sampler hang fix): the control, the production recipe, first of two. Arms alternate A B A B in this one image, each after its own
# all-four reset, same admission order: A = c2-packed-tp4-speed-strace, B = c2-packed-tp4-speed-strace-fcommit; the pair differs in QWEN_FAST_FUSED_COMMIT, _INPLACE and _LIVE_BANKS alone (test_tp4_next3_window).
# The tests: warmup, coding, concurrent4_code_equal (four real-code prompts of 4k) and concurrent4_code_32k (four real-code prompts of 32k), 800 tokens out each.
# Read: the '[PACKED-PHASE]' lines (commits: about 36.8 ms at four users today, the arm's target at most about 12 ms; the round wall; the per-user decode_tok_s) and '[PACKED-PUBLISH]' medians at 4 live.
# Judge the arms PAIRED per round, never by unpaired medians; check the load average around the run (a busy host skews host phases 10 to 20 percent) and repeat before believing a small gap.
# Then offline: python scripts/ci/speed_window_compare.py <A results> <B results> --users 0,1,2,3 --position-keyed --strict-concurrent-prefixes (exit 0 identical): the lever is a byte-identical replacement,
# so every user's text and accepted-prefix sequence must be IDENTICAL between A and B, and B's 4k texts must equal S3's audited ones.
# OPTIONAL, run only after S4a..S4e all completed: a hang on a timed arm is a finding, and the control carries the same hang fix.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1 to 3 min, engine build 10 to 20 min, the four tests 15 to 35 min: 60 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/next-3-scope window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/next-3-scope and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image a build-only job (C2_ACTIONS=build, no card opened) builds from this branch while
# production serves; a later commit of scripts needs a new build and tag. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-3s is a PLACEHOLDER the driver may substitute.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next-3s
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-speed-strace
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent4_code_32k
